{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original score for <i>Talisman: Digital 5th Edition</i>. Composed and created by Dan Meadowcroft, the soundtrack comes as 9 tracks in both MP3 and high-quality WAV format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the <i>Talisman: Digital 5th Edition</i> soundtrack we\u2019ve included a bonus as thanks for supporting the game, the previously unreleased soundtrack for <i>Talisman: Origins</i>, featuring 10 tracks composed and created by Dan Meadowcroft. These bonus tracks also come in both MP3 and high-quality WAV format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for setting the mood while playing the Talisman board game or listening to on it\u2019s own, we hope you enjoy this official soundtrack!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837770?t=1752135093","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3837770?t=1752135093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837770/e85b21340025b99af1973b371129a4fa94261b7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752135093","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837770/e85b21340025b99af1973b371129a4fa94261b7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752135093","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original score for <i>Talisman: Digital 5th Edition</i>. Composed and created by Dan Meadowcroft, the soundtrack comes as 9 tracks in both MP3 and high-quality WAV format.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the <i>Talisman: Digital 5th Edition</i> soundtrack we\u2019ve included a bonus as thanks for supporting the game, the previously unreleased soundtrack for <i>Talisman: Origins</i>, featuring 10 tracks composed and created by Dan Meadowcroft. These bonus tracks also come in both MP3 and high-quality WAV format.</p